name: Golden Ticket — gold economy
author: corpus
description: >-
  Golden Ticket earns $4 per played Gold card when scored. Lua has both an unlock condition
  and `enhancement_gate`: real shops require Gold-card access before it can appear; Motely can
  still search the raw first-shop slot. Midas Mask creates Gold face cards; Pareidolia turns
  every card into a face card. RAG aliases: gold economy, Midas money, played Gold card cash.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: GoldenTicket
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: MidasMask
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Pareidolia
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
